The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository.

The datasets are third-party and carry their own licences, recorded per dataset in
`data/MANIFEST.json`:

  NYC TLC Yellow Taxi & Zone Lookup   NYC Open Data / TLC, public domain
  IBM Telco Customer Churn            Apache-2.0 (IBM sample data)
  UCI Online Retail                   CC BY 4.0
  UCI Adult / Census Income           CC BY 4.0
  UCI Bike Sharing                    CC BY 4.0
  KDD Cup 1999                        Public domain (DARPA / MIT Lincoln Labs)
  Tiny Shakespeare                    Public domain

All are freely redistributable for research and education. Attribution for each
is in `data/MANIFEST.json` and on the Data provenance page of the console.
